        "Disallow justifications grounded in the absence of disproof (e.g., 'Nobody has proven this won't work').",
        "Require explicit falsification criteria: 'What observable result would prove our initial hypothesis wrong?'",
        "Review project milestones against these benchmarks to discontinue unfounded projects promptly."
